! ---------------------------------------------------------------------
! CTS bootstrap - runs on each SDA fabric device that participates in
! TrustSec (classification, propagation, or enforcement).
!
! Prerequisites (pushed by CC's standard provisioning, not here):
!   - radius server ISE-RADIUS / key <shared_secret>     (from network_settings.aaa_servers)
!   - aaa group server radius                            (CC creates from same config)
!
! What this template adds:
!   1. AAA method list named CTS-AUTHZ-LIST that uses the RADIUS group
!   2. cts authorization list CTS-AUTHZ-LIST - tells CTS which AAA list to use
!
! NOTE: 'cts credentials id/password' is intentionally omitted here.
! That command requires TrustSec to be initialized on the device first
! (CTS PAC provisioning must complete via ISE before the command is valid).
! Push it manually after the first successful CTS handshake:
!   cts credentials id <device_name> password <cts_password>
! ---------------------------------------------------------------------

aaa authorization network CTS-AUTHZ-LIST group radius
cts authorization list CTS-AUTHZ-LIST
